  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports asset health and predictive maintenance across 20 heavy industrial assets at IronPulse. Stakeholders: Plant Manager and Reliability Engineering (daily condition trends, intervention triggers), VP Operations (availability, MTBF, unplanned downtime), and CFO (maintenance spend, predicted-failure ROI versus breakdown cost).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Health index = AVG(health_index); healthy ≥80, watch 50–79, critical <50.\n- Vibration = AVG(vibration_velocity_mm_s); ISO 10816 alert at 4.5, danger at 11.2 mm/s.\n- Bearing temp = AVG(bearing_temperature_c); typical alarm threshold ~85°C.\n- RUL = AVG(remaining_useful_life_days); under 30 days flags imminent intervention.\n- Availability = AVG(availability_pct); world-class ≥90%, leaders 95%+.\n- Unplanned downtime = SUM(unplanned_downtime_hours); leading lagging indicator of MTBF.\n- Prediction catch rate = SUM(predicted_failures_caught) / COUNT(failure_events) (target ≥60%).\n- Maintenance cost = SUM(maintenance_cost_usd); benchmark 2–4% of asset replacement value.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - condition_readings_metrics (source: condition_readings) — dims: reading_date, asset_type, manufacturer; measures: avg_vibration_velocity, avg_bearing_temp, avg_health_index, avg_rul_days, unique_asset_count, max_vibration_velocity_mm_s.\n  - asset_health_monthly_metrics (source: asset_health_monthly) — dims: summary_month, asset_type, manufacturer; measures: avg_availability, total_maintenance_cost, total_predicted_caught, total_unplanned_downtime, unique_asset_count.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. asset_id, failure_mode, detection_method, severity, repair_cost_usd, was_predicted).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 assets by unplanned downtime hours in the last 90 days, and what was their average health index?",
    "Show monthly trend in average health index by asset type across the trailing 12 months.",
    "Which assets currently have vibration velocity in the ISO 10816 Danger zone (≥11.2 mm/s)?",
    "What share of failures in the last 6 months were caught by the prediction model, broken out by asset type?",
    "Rank manufacturers by average asset availability — which are below the 90% world-class threshold?",
    "Monthly trend in total maintenance cost vs unplanned downtime hours across the network.",
    "Top 10 assets by repair cost from breakdown-detected failures — what is the cost gap versus sensor-detected ones?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has average lubricant oil temperature in celsius trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, AVG(oil_temperature_c) AS avg_oil_temperature_c",
        "FROM {fqn}.condition_readings",
        "GROUP BY reading_date",
        "ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average vibration velocity in mm/s changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, MEASURE(avg_vibration_velocity) AS avg_vibration_velocity",
        "FROM {fqn}.condition_readings_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total average health index?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', summary_month) AS month, MEASURE(total_avg_health_index) AS total_avg_health_index",
        "FROM {fqn}.asset_health_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Rank asset types by total unplanned downtime hours",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT asset_type, MEASURE(total_unplanned_downtime) AS total_unplanned_downtime",
        "FROM {fqn}.asset_health_monthly_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY total_unplanned_downtime DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total bearing temperature in celsius over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, SUM(bearing_temperature_c) AS total_bearing_temperature_c",
        "FROM {fqn}.condition_readings",
        "GROUP BY reading_date ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total downtime caused by failure in hours over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT failure_date, SUM(downtime_hours) AS total_downtime_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.failure_events",
        "GROUP BY failure_date ORDER BY failure_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average average health index for the month 0-100 changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT summary_month, AVG(avg_health_index) AS avg_avg_health_index",
        "FROM {fqn}.asset_health_monthly",
        "GROUP BY summary_month ORDER BY summary_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
